---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
---
<Base title="About" description="What a howff is, and why this one exists." path="/about">
  <Header />
  <main class="page">
    <div class="wrap prose">
      <p class="kicker">About</p>
      <h1>A place you go.</h1>
      <p>
        Howff is a Scots word for a haunt. A meeting-place. The pub you keep going back to.
        This one is for the bits you keep handing your bot.
      </p>
      <p class="muted">Pronounced HOWFF · how + f. Not an acronym.</p>
      <h2>The gap</h2>
      <p>
        MCP dirs list servers. Skill indexes list SKILL.md files. Templates live elsewhere.
        The three catalogues do not share a shelf. Howff does.
      </p>
      <p>
        Same schema. Same pull request. Same dry tone. MIT. No accounts.
        The repo is the CMS: one JSON file per entry in data/entries.
      </p>
      <p>
        Kept by Nikola Babic. Org howffdotdev.
        Site <a href="https://howff.dev">howff.dev</a>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </main>
  <Footer />
</Base>
